# Helm values

<!-- Generated by hack/helm-docs.sh from deploy/chart/values.yaml (make helm-docs). Do not edit. -->

Every value of the `{{ template "chart.name" . }}` chart (version {{ template "chart.version" . }}),
from the comments in [`deploy/chart/values.yaml`](https://github.com/abd-ulbasit/upgradescope/blob/main/deploy/chart/values.yaml).
`values.schema.json` rejects unknown keys, an `agent.interval` under one
minute and targets that are not `MAJOR.MINOR`, so a typo fails the render
instead of being ignored. Installing and configuring the chart:
[Install](../operations/install.md) and the
[chart README](https://github.com/abd-ulbasit/upgradescope/blob/main/deploy/chart/README.md).

